Detail Maps is adapted from InTheBottle's Bottled Shaders:
https://github.com/InTheBottle/Bottled-Shaders/tree/Bottle-Compendium

The original feature implementation and shader are covered by the
repository's GPL-3.0-or-later license and exceptions (COPYING and
EXCEPTIONS.md). CSX adapts rendering integration for SE, AE and VR.

The separate Detail Maps texture and rule pack is available at:
https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/197436
Its author identifies the source materials as CC0. No pack textures
are redistributed with this feature.
